hat month's margin down to roughly 59% versus ~63% in May and June. On the positive side, the support team's ticket close rate actually improved as the quarter progressed even as ticket volume declined, suggesting no backlog buildup.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
